# The Pokémon League's grounds (the original's CITY10 role): the great hall on its plateau at the end of Victory
# Road, the Pokémon Center and the last shop before the Elite Four, and the doors the whole journey has led to. A
# grand, ceremonial B-flat processional: brass in dotted steps, the horn beneath, a harp rolling, the timpani and a
# parade snare keeping the stately pace and bells pealing at the ends of phrases; the second half looks back once,
# through a borrowed minor chord, before turning towards the doors again. By night the horn and a clarinet over a
# pad and a celesta. Original composition for this game.
